    "body": "1. We don't do `[type=text i]` consistently now and with the recent revert of case-insensitive attributes values I guess that would only affect XHTML, but I suppose I should still change that. I'll try to change the others too.\n2. Good point about `:not([type])`. I still think we want `[type=text i]` too though for when it is specified, no?\n",
